## solution

#### using a stack

```js
const nestingScore = (str) => {
  const stack = [0];
  for (let char of str) {
    if (char === '[') {
      stack.push(0);
    } else {
      const popped = stack.pop();
      if (popped === 0) {
        stack[stack.length - 1] += 1;
      } else {
        stack[stack.length - 1] += 2 * popped;
      }
    }
  }

  return stack[0];
};
```

- n = length of string
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

